1. Load and follow [master-planner/SKILL.md](../master-planner/SKILL.md).
2. Core thesis (verbatim): *A true master plan, to me, is only one thing: an interconnected, inter-related web of friction-removing automations aimed at impossible missions that great vision makes real.*
